        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1754798612}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Magandang araw, Bayani! Ngayon ay Ikatatlo natin ang unang bahagi
            ng iyong paglalakbay sa Noli Me Tangere. Tatalakayin natin ang mahahalagang
            pangyayari mula Kabanata 14 hanggang 20
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1754798612}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1754798612}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1021755073}
          direction: 1
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1466231927}
          direction: 1
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1846180247}
          direction: 1
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1846180247}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1754798612}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Magandang araw, Bayani! Sa kabanatang ito, makikita natin ang masalimuot
            na mundo ng San Diego, kung saan ang kasamaan, intriga, at lihim ng lipunan
            ay naglalaro. Pansinin ninyo kung paano nakakaapekto ang kapangyarihan
            ng simbahan, ang taktika ng mga makapangyarihan, at ang mga lihim na
            bumabalot sa bawat tauhan.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1021755073}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1466231927}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1846180247}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1754798612}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: cc93af5ed8ab5a549ad8ce35a54cd03d, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Makikita rito ang tema ng intriga at kolonyal na kapangyarihan. Ipinapakita
            ang tensyon sa pagitan ng mga tauhan at kung paano ginagamit ng simbahan
            ang impluwensya nito laban sa reporma at pagbabago
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1754798612}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: 398388ec98e803045b176ad88ea3dab8, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Dito lumilitaw ang tema ng lihim at kabutihan. Si Elias ay kumakatawan
            sa tulong at katarungan na madalas ginagawa sa lihim upang maiwasan ang
            kapangyarihan ng mas makapangyarihang tauhan
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1754798612}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: beccca99aca90ba4088bdb8717fb3198, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Ang larawang ito ay sumisimbolo sa mga lihim at intriga sa lipunan.
            Ipinapakita kung paano ang impormasyon, lihim, at komunikasyon ay puwedeng
            magbago ng kapalaran ng tauhan
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1021755073}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1466231927}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
